  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.knidia.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.knidia.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.knidia.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_knidia">
        <head>ΚΝΙΔΙΑ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1">
          <head>I.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1-l1">Οὐδὲν γένους γένος γὰρ οἶμαι διαφέρειν,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1-l2">ἀλλ᾽ εἰ δικαίως ἐξετάσεις, καὶ γνήσιος</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1-l3">ὁ χρηστός ἐστιν, ὁ δὲ πονηρὸς καὶ νόθος.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. LXXXVI 10 cum lemmate <quote>Μενάνδρου Κνηδία</quote> (sic).</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 libri οὐθέν. — Vs. 2 Voss. ἐξετάσης.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1_2-l1">Quo quis sit genere, nil ego referre arbitror.</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1_2-l2">quod si rem potius spectes quam vocis sonum,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-1_2-l3">legitimus est frugi omnis, et nequam nothus.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2-l1">Ταὐτόματόν ἐστιν ὡς ἔοικέ που θεός,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2-l2">σώζει τε πολλὰ τῶν ἀοράτων πραγμάτων.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Ecl. phys. I p. 196.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Respexit fortasse Palladas Alex. epigr. CVIII: <quote>εὖ γε λέγων τὸν καιρὸν ἔφης θεὸν εὖ γε Μένανδρε</quote>, et paullo post: <quote>πολλάκι γὰρ τοῦ σφόδρα μεριμνηθέντος ἄμεινον προσπεσὸν εὐκαίρως εὗρέ τι ταὐτόματον.</quote>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2_2-l1">Casus quoque ipse est nescio quid numinis,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-knidia-2_2-l2">et res plerasque nos latendo sospitat.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
